# shop_loft — a MULTI-LEVEL part (Phase 20): a ground-floor shop with a storage
# loft above it, joined by a stair. The part carries its own `level 1` room, a
# `stair`, loft + shop windows, and a loft alarm; the host `use ... level n`
# offsets them all, and validation sees the FINAL levels on the composed plan
# (loft guard, stair rise, per-storey alarm, garage separation all fire against
# the real levels). Place the south + east walls exterior (they carry the glass).
param loft_depth = 16
room shop: shop at 0,0 size 24 x 24
room loft: loft at 0,0 size 24 x loft_depth level 1
stair st at 19,0 size 4 x 15 from 0 to 1
window shop south width 10 offset 4
window shop east width 10 offset 8
window loft south width 9 offset 3
window loft east width 9 offset 4
alarm smoke in loft
